ding of CI/CD principles and hands-on experience with CI/CD tools. Proficiency in scripting languages such as Python, Bash, or similar. Experience with infrastructure as code (Terraform, Ansible, etc.). Familiarity with cloud platforms like AWS, GCP, or Azure. Excellent communication and collaboration skills. Ability to work independently and as part of a team. Strong problem-solving and analytical skills. Fluency in English Benefits: Competitive salary and benefits. Opportunity to work remotely, flex time. International projects; Travel opportunities. Positive team atmosphere and plenty of room to grow.";https://hh.ru/vacancy/105292449
